{ type: install
  message: <<EOM
Automatic background-server startup is disabled by default on FreeBSD.
The optional per-user background server needs no rc service.
Use --no-daemon to explicitly run with an embedded server.

If you use the background server, it keeps its own copy of the Codex package.
After upgrading Codex with pkg, refresh that copy as your regular user:

  codex app-server daemon update --from-cli

This asks for confirmation and restarts a running server, interrupting active
work. Upstream automatic binary updates are disabled on FreeBSD.
EOM
}
{ type: upgrade
  message: <<EOM
If you have used the Codex background server, refresh its private package copy
as your regular user after upgrading:

  codex app-server daemon update --from-cli

This asks for confirmation and restarts a running server, interrupting active
work. Upstream automatic binary updates are disabled on FreeBSD; use pkg.
EOM
}
]
